    "https://www.sc.edu/about/offices_and_divisions/career_center/index.php": {
      "title": "Tools & Resources",
      "description": "Career Center - Career Center | University of South Carolina Skip to Content University of South Carolina Home Search University of South Carolina University of South Carolina Navigation Search sc.edu Gateways For: STUDENTS FACULTY & STAFF ALUMNI PARENTS & FAMILIES Calendar Map Directory Apply Give Search sc.edu Search Career Center Student Career Hub Plan a Career Career Coaching Assessment Tools Decision Making Process Career Courses Gain Experience Internships and Co-ops Carolina Internship Program Informational Interviewing Job Shadowing Job Shadowing for Employers Job Shadowing for Students Code of Conduct Part-Time Jobs Write a Resume Chronological Resume Curriculum Vitae Federal Resume Cover Letters Prep for Interviews Pre-Interview Research Practice Interviews On-Campus Interviews Search for Jobs Job Fairs and Events Information Sessions Job Postings Networking Explore Graduate School Use Career Center Tools Access Financial Support Cocky Career Guides Carolina Career Competencies Graduate Student Advising Employer Partnerships Post Your Vacancies Recruit a Gamecock Career Fairs Host an In-person or Virtual event Interviewing Build Internships & Co-Ops Develop Your Recruitment Strategy Become a Partner Most Engaged Employers Faculty Partnerships Classroom Presentations Letters of Reference Employer Referrals Career Champion Events for Faculty and Staff Alumni Support Assessment and Coaching Job Fairs and Events Search for Jobs Interview Preparation On-Campus Interviewing Managing Your Handshake Alumni Account Data & Outcomes About the Career Center Our Location Staff Directory Contact Us Policies No Show Policy Career Center Tools Social Media Extended Virtual Services Tools & Resources Calendar Map Directory Apply Give Student Gateway Faculty & Staff Gateway Parents & Families Gateway Alumni Gateway Career Center NEW Iris Headshot Booth Get a FREE professional headshot with our new Iris Headshot Booth. Self-serve and no appointment needed with instant digital delivery. Check it out! SC.edu About Offices and Divisions Career Center Career Center Student Career Hub Graduate Student Advising Employer Partnerships Faculty Partnerships Alumni Support Data & Outcomes About the Career Center Your career journey starts here. Whether you're exploring majors, preparing for internships,\n                           or launching into life after graduation, we're here to help you build skills, discover\n                           options, and connect with opportunities that move you forward. Every year, thousands\n                           of students gain clarity and confidence through our programs — from choosing a major\n                           to landing that first job — made possible by a community that believes in student\n                           career success. Support the University Career Center If you’re passionate about helping Gamecocks step boldly into their futures, we invite\n                                    you to support the Career Center programs that make this impact possible. Your contribution fuels real opportunities, real growth, and real futures. Whatever you're aiming for, we'll help you get there. Carolina Career Competencies Learn the skills you need to grow and succeed professionally. Four Year Career Plans Four years. One roadmap. We’ve got you from freshman year to career launch. Career Coaching Talk it out, map it out — your next move starts here. Assessments Discover your strengths, values, and vibe — so your career actually fits YOU. Cocky Career Guides Step-by-step resources for job search, internships and everything in between. Graduate Student Advising Advanced goals need advanced guidance — we’re here to help you get there. Career Docs Build a résumé that makes employers stop scrolling and start reading. Interview Essentials Walk in confident and ready, walk out knowing you nailed it. LinkedIn Literacy From headshot to headline, level up your LinkedIn like a pro. Internships & Co-ops Real-world experience, zero fluff — your time to explore, learn and earn. South Carolina Internship Program (SCIP) Your South Carolina internship just got more rewarding — literally. Find a Job From part-time to post-grad — start your job search with confidence. Events Career-powered gatherings where opportunities meet you. Career Center Tools All the career gear in one place — from job search to skill builder. Cocky Career Ready Your 24/7 AI career sidekick — anytime tips, on-demand, always ready. Data & Outcomes See what past Gamecocks are doing, so you can chart your own path forward. Iris Headshot Booth Main character energy — now in professional lighting. Employer Partnerships Recruit, connect, and grow your presence on campus. Career Center Location Contact Calendar Social Media USC Facebook USC Instagram USC X Colleges & Schools Arts and Sciences Business Education Engineering and Computing The Graduate School Hospitality, Retail and Sport Management Information and Communications Law Medicine Medicine (Greenville) Music Nursing Pharmacy Public Health Social Work South Carolina Honors College Palmetto College Offices & Divisions Employment Undergraduate Admissions Financial Aid and Scholarships Bursar (fee payment) Veterans and Military Services Disability Resources Access and Opportunity Human Resources Law Enforcement and Safety University Libraries All Offices and Divisions Tools Carolina Alert Campus Email my.sc.edu Blackboard Campus Safety and Wellness PeopleSoft Finance © University of South Carolina Privacy Student Consumer Information Student Consumer Information Transparency Initiative Civil Rights and Title IX Digital Accessibility Contact Challenge the conventional. Create the exceptional. No Limits. ©"
    },
    "https://www.sc.edu/about/offices_and_divisions/career_center/student_career_hub/plan_a_career/index.php": {
      "title": "Tools & Resources",
      "description": "Plan a Career - Career Center | University of South Carolina Skip to Content University of South Carolina Home Search University of South Carolina University of South Carolina Navigation Search sc.edu Gateways For: STUDENTS FACULTY & STAFF ALUMNI PARENTS & FAMILIES Calendar Map Directory Apply Give Search sc.edu Search Career Center Student Career Hub Plan a Career Career Coaching Assessment Tools Decision Making Process Career Courses Gain Experience Internships and Co-ops Carolina Internship Program Informational Interviewing Job Shadowing Job Shadowing for Employers Job Shadowing for Students Code of Conduct Part-Time Jobs Write a Resume Chronological Resume Curriculum Vitae Federal Resume Cover Letters Prep for Interviews Pre-Interview Research Practice Interviews On-Campus Interviews Search for Jobs Job Fairs and Events Information Sessions Job Postings Networking Explore Graduate School Use Career Center Tools Access Financial Support Cocky Career Guides Carolina Career Competencies Graduate Student Advising Employer Partnerships Post Your Vacancies Recruit a Gamecock Career Fairs Host an In-person or Virtual event Interviewing Build Internships & Co-Ops Develop Your Recruitment Strategy Become a Partner Most Engaged Employers Faculty Partnerships Classroom Presentations Letters of Reference Employer Referrals Career Champion Events for Faculty and Staff Alumni Support Assessment and Coaching Job Fairs and Events Search for Jobs Interview Preparation On-Campus Interviewing Managing Your Handshake Alumni Account Data & Outcomes About the Career Center Our Location Staff Directory Contact Us Policies No Show Policy Career Center Tools Social Media Extended Virtual Services Tools & Resources Calendar Map Directory Apply Give Student Gateway Faculty & Staff Gateway Parents & Families Gateway Alumni Gateway Career Center SC.edu About Offices and Divisions Career Center Student Services Plan a Career Career Center Student Career Hub Graduate Student Advising Employer Partnerships Faculty Partnerships Alumni Support Data & Outcomes About the Career Center Plan a Career Gain Experience Write a Resume Prep for Interviews Search for Jobs Explore Graduate School Use Career Center Tools Access Financial Support Cocky Career Guides Carolina Career Competencies Career Coaching Assessment Tools Career Courses Plan a Career Our staff members will work directly with you throughout the complex process of choosing\n                        a career and preparing for a job or graduate school search. Explore Your Options Review your four year career plan, and identify your strengths and interests with\n                                    our assessment tools. Then, meet with one of our career coaches. They can help you\n                                    align your academics with your professional goals and plan your next steps. Getting Started Check out the four year career plan for your major. This will help guide you through\n                                             the career-related objectives you should be focused on each year in order to build\n                                             a strong, career-ready foundation. Career Coaching Our staff members work directly with students throughout the complex process of choosing\n                                             a career. Assessment Tools Our career assessment tools are designed to target your interests, personality, and\n                                             work values, while empowering you to make an informed decision about your future. Handshake Search for jobs, internships, and events such as career fairs and networking engagements\n                                       through the university's premiere career management platform, Handshake. Career Center Location Contact Calendar Social Media USC Facebook USC Instagram USC X Colleges & Schools Arts and Sciences Business Education Engineering and Computing The Graduate School Hospitality, Retail and Sport Management Information and Communications Law Medicine Medicine (Greenville) Music Nursing Pharmacy Public Health Social Work South Carolina Honors College Palmetto College Offices & Divisions Employment Undergraduate Admissions Financial Aid and Scholarships Bursar (fee payment) Veterans and Military Services Disability Resources Access and Opportunity Human Resources Law Enforcement and Safety University Libraries All Offices and Divisions Tools Carolina Alert Campus Email my.sc.edu Blackboard Campus Safety and Wellness PeopleSoft Finance © University of South Carolina Privacy Student Consumer Information Student Consumer Information Transparency Initiative Civil Rights and Title IX Digital Accessibility Contact Challenge the conventional. Create the exceptional. No Limits. ©"
